WEBVTT

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.216
It's also bad for business.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.604
There's rigorous evidence showing
that when people feel lonely at work,

00:07:34.628 --> 00:07:36.386
their job performance falters.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.458
In research at both
a manufacturing company

00:07:38.482 --> 00:07:39.734
and a city government,

00:07:39.758 --> 00:07:41.784
when employees reported feeling lonely,

00:07:41.808 --> 00:07:45.686
they got lower performance ratings
from their supervisors six weeks later.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:46.868
Why?

00:07:46.892 --> 00:07:50.266
When they felt lonely, they were
less committed and less approachable.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:53.663
That meant other people were less likely
to reach out and support them,

00:07:53.687 --> 00:07:55.414
which only compounded the problem.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.446
Loneliness can affect
a whole group of people at work.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.922
So the question is
how to solve it collectively.